{
	"nodes": [
		{
			"id": "welcome",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "# Welcome to ThinkBoard\n\nThis is a **scratch board** \u2014 play with it freely. Nothing here is saved, and it comes back each time you launch without a board of your own.",
			"x": -825,
			"y": -365,
			"width": 635,
			"height": 215
		},
		{
			"id": "action_new",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Create your first board** \u2192",
			"x": -848,
			"y": -48,
			"width": 363,
			"height": 109,
			"color": "4",
			"tb_action": "new_board",
			"tb_primary": true
		},
		{
			"id": "action_open",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Open an existing board\u2026 \u2192",
			"x": -451,
			"y": -36,
			"width": 272,
			"height": 86,
			"color": "5",
			"tb_action": "open_board"
		},
		{
			"id": "tip_canvas",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Boards are Obsidian `.canvas` files. ThinkBoard reads and writes them in place and keeps anything it doesn't use, so a board stays one Obsidian can open.",
			"x": -1278,
			"y": -558,
			"width": 363,
			"height": 170
		},
		{
			"id": "action_vault",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Use an Obsidian vault\u2026 \u2192",
			"x": -1256,
			"y": -297,
			"width": 317,
			"height": 82,
			"tb_action": "open_vault",
			"color": "#c8a54b"
		},
		{
			"id": "tip_edit",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Double-click** any card to edit. Press **Esc** or **Cmd/Ctrl+Enter** when you're done.",
			"x": 36,
			"y": -637,
			"width": 476,
			"height": 82
		},
		{
			"id": "tip_connect",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Hover a card's edge to reveal a **dot**, then drag it onto another card to connect them.",
			"x": 36,
			"y": -524,
			"width": 476,
			"height": 82
		},
		{
			"id": "tip_summon",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "SUMMON",
			"x": 36,
			"y": -410,
			"width": 476,
			"height": 82
		},
		{
			"id": "tip_palette",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Cmd/Ctrl+K** or **Cmd/Ctrl+P** opens the command palette \u2014 every action, searchable: switch board, change theme or font, auto-layout, group.",
			"x": 36,
			"y": -297,
			"width": 476,
			"height": 104
		},
		{
			"id": "tip_settings",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Open **Settings** from the menu-bar icon \u2014 themes, fonts, AI, and how the board behaves.",
			"x": 36,
			"y": -161,
			"width": 476,
			"height": 82
		},
		{
			"id": "tip_right_click",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Right-click empty space for board options like **Auto-layout** and **Snap to grid**.",
			"x": 36,
			"y": -48,
			"width": 476,
			"height": 82
		},
		{
			"id": "tip_ai",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Ask AI** turns a chain of cards into a prompt and writes the reply back onto the board.",
			"x": 36,
			"y": 66,
			"width": 476,
			"height": 82
		},
		{
			"id": "tip_summon_hotkey",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "SUMMON_HOTKEY",
			"x": 592,
			"y": -422,
			"width": 351,
			"height": 104
		},
		{
			"id": "tip_ai_provider",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "It needs a provider first \u2014 **Settings \u2192 AI**, pick one and paste a key. Until then the menu item stays hidden.",
			"x": 592,
			"y": 54,
			"width": 351,
			"height": 104
		}
	],
